    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a24">

                <pb facs="0569" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg519"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 24.—From Buenos Ayres to
                        Lisbon.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-03"><hi rendition="#small-caps">April</hi> 3,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Navy:</hi></p>
                <p>It would be better to buy Italian steamer on prompt payment and depart for its
                    destination, San Vincent, without the least delay with the Italian crew and my
                    officers.</p>
                <p>It is known officially that a lieutenant asylumed on the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Alfonso de Albuquerque has</hi> died. Two soldiers from the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Mindello</hi> were sent to the floating hospital with
                    the fever.</p>
                <p>The situation is very grave when it rains.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castilho.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
